## Fix live scenario campaign interpreter and staged Generate

Context: `make scenario-campaign` sourced `.venv/bin/activate` while
`VIRTUAL_ENV` still pointed at the 0.8.1 worktree, so pytest ran 0.8.1
scenario files against the 0.9 app. Scenario 1 then clicked Detect Entities
and polled `/ontology/load` for classes — Stage 1 never merges OWL, so the
run timed out with an empty class list.

Changes:

1. `Makefile`
   Campaign uses `env -u VIRTUAL_ENV uv run --frozen pytest` from this
   worktree (no `activate`).
2. `tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_01_generate_live.py`
   Detect → poll draft `reviewing` → Continue to Complete → poll classes.
3. `tests/units/e2e/test_scenario_campaign_wiring.py`
   Contracts for the Makefile recipe and the staged wizard walk.
4. `tests/e2e/scenarios/README.md`, `docs/development.md`
   Campaign interpreter + Stage 1/3 timeouts documented.

