## Drive Stage 3 completion from the live scenario API

Context: After the staged Generate update, scenario 1 detected 11 candidates
then clicked Continue. The draft stayed at `reviewing` with 0 classes for
420s — Stage 3 never started. Detection is async; Continue stays disabled
until Review re-renders, so a DOM click is the wrong trigger. Completion
must POST `/ontology/wizard/generate/complete` (the same call the button
makes) and poll the task, then assert `/ontology/load` has classes.

Changes:

1. `tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_01_generate_live.py`
   After a reviewing draft, POST complete, poll the task, assert classes.
2. `tests/units/e2e/test_scenario_campaign_wiring.py`
   Contract: detect click, then complete POST, then ontology load.

Modified files:
- tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_01_generate_live.py
- tests/units/e2e/test_scenario_campaign_wiring.py

